TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Yağmurlu günlerde normalden de fazla
uykum geliyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
İyi ki ziyarete geldin; suratın kocaman
bir çalar saat gibi!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Şimdiden biraz ayıldım!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}I've been in the best mood all
morning.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} This rain really is the best,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}He estado muy animado toda la
mañana.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Esta lluvia es una pasada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}È tutta la mattina che sono di
buon umore.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Adoro la pioggia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Was für ein schöner Morgen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Dieser Regen ist einfach wunderbar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Der Regen lässt {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ziemlich
geheimnisvoll wirken, oder?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ich komme mir vor wie im Film,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Yağmur {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a biraz gizemli
bir hava veriyor, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Sanki filmdeyiz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Las noches de lluvia son lo
mejor para salir a dar un paseo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Es gibt nichts Schöneres als einen
Abendspaziergang im Regen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}It's late and raining, and that means
it's about time for bed, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Seriously, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Es tarde y llueve, así que toca irse
a dormir, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
En serio, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}È tardi e piove! Non ci resta altro
che andare a nanna, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Arrivo pigiamino mio, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Geç oldu, yağmur da yağıyor; yani yatma
vakti geldi, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Cidden, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hi, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Isn't getting pelted
by rain the best feeling in the world,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merhaba, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yağmurun tepene tepene yağması dünyadaki
en güzel his değil mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
